'''Chuckleton''' is an [[NPC]] that appeared twice in the {{Zone|Village}}. He first hosted [[A Honk and Seek Adventure]] in 2025 and then the second [[Bingo|Secret Bingo]] in 2026.

== Purpose ==
=== [[Secret Bingo]] ===
During the second [[Bingo|Secret Bingo]] in April 2026, '''Chuckleton''' served as a replacement for {{NPCSprite|Bingo;Bingo}}, allowing players to participate in the event, view their [[Bingo Card]], and access the [[Bingo Shop]]. He also gave items for completing goals.

=== [[A Honk and Seek Adventure]] ===
During [[A Honk and Seek Adventure]], '''Chuckleton''' tasked the player with obtaining various items. Nearly every item referenced another item in SkyBlock.
